{"type":"standard","title":"Wes Climer","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Wes Climer</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q96361629","titles":{"canonical":"Wes_Climer","normalized":"Wes Climer","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Wes Climer</span></span>"},"pageid":64166287,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375131493","tid":"8881fadf-b16c-11f1-a8a7-bd01a5bacab9","timestamp":"2026-09-16T01:18:33Z","description":"American politician (born 1982)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wes_Climer","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wes_Climer?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wes_Climer?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Wes_Climer"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wes_Climer","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Wes_Climer","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wes_Climer?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Wes_Climer"}},"extract":"David Wesley Climer is an American politician. Since 2016, Climer has represented the 15th District (York) in the South Carolina Senate. He is a member of the Republican Party. He resigned from the state senate, effective November 3, 2026.","extract_html":"<p><b>David Wesley Climer</b> is an American politician. Since 2016, Climer has represented the 15th District (York) in the South Carolina Senate. He is a member of the Republican Party. He resigned from the state senate, effective November 3, 2026.</p>"}